  maxHealth: 30
  contactDamage: 1
  scoreReward: 400
  description: Sworn to carry the Castellan's errands and, apparently, to die holding
    a crossbow taller than himself. The helmet was a hand-me-down. So was the war.
  tactics: One of two guards that make the Baron untouchable - his greyed bar takes
    NOTHING until both fall. Squires are brittle (30 HP) but their bolts add up while
    you linger. Pick one, burst it down, then mirror it. Each fallen Squire pays
    a reward and drops a powerup for the real fight.
  displayName: Baron's Squire
